== architecture ==
- three storage regions
  - 三个存储区域
  - memory with 15-bit address space storing 16-bit values
    - 具有 15 位地址空间、存储 16 位值的内存
  - eight registers
    - 八个寄存器
  - an unbounded stack which holds individual 16-bit values
    - 一个可存放单个 16 位值的无界栈
- all numbers are unsigned integers 0..32767 (15-bit)
  - 所有数字均为无符号整数 0..32767（15 位）
- all math is modulo 32768; 32758 + 15 => 5
  - 所有算术运算均按模 32768 进行；32758 + 15 => 5

== binary format ==
- each number is stored as a 16-bit little-endian pair (low byte, high byte)
  - 每个数字以 16 位小端序对存储（低字节、高字节）
- numbers 0..32767 mean a literal value
  - 数字 0..32767 表示字面量值
- numbers 32768..32775 instead mean registers 0..7
  - 数字 32768..32775 则表示寄存器 0..7
- numbers 32776..65535 are invalid
  - 数字 32776..65535 无效
- programs are loaded into memory starting at address 0
  - 程序从地址 0 开始加载到内存
- address 0 is the first 16-bit value, address 1 is the second 16-bit value, etc
  - 地址 0 是第一个 16 位值，地址 1 是第二个 16 位值，依此类推

== execution ==
- After an operation is executed, the next instruction to read is immediately after the last argument of the current operation.
  If a jump was performed, the next operation is instead the exact destination of the jump.
  - 一条操作执行后，下一条待读指令紧跟当前操作的最后一个参数。
    若发生跳转，下一条操作则位于跳转的精确目的地址。
- Encountering a register as an operation argument should be taken as reading from the register or setting into the register as appropriate.
  - 当寄存器编码出现在操作参数中时，应按上下文将其解释为读取该寄存器，或写入该寄存器。

== hints ==
- Start with operations 0, 19, and 21.
  - 可以从操作 0、19 和 21 开始。
- Here's a code for the challenge website: jTTockJlJiOC
  - 挑战网站的代码：jTTockJlJiOC
- The program "9,32768,32769,4,19,32768" occupies six memory addresses and should:
  - 程序 "9,32768,32769,4,19,32768" 占用六个内存地址，其作用应为：
  - Store into register 0 the sum of 4 and the value contained in register 1.
    - 将 4 与寄存器 1 当前值的和存入寄存器 0。
  - Output to the terminal the character with the ascii code contained in register 0.
    - 向终端输出寄存器 0 中 ASCII 码对应的字符。

== opcode listing ==
halt: 0
  stop execution and terminate the program
  停止执行并终止程序
set: 1 a b
  set register <a> to the value of <b>
  将寄存器 <a> 设为 <b> 的值
push: 2 a
  push <a> onto the stack
  将 <a> 压入栈
pop: 3 a
  remove the top element from the stack and write it into <a>; empty stack = error
  移除栈顶元素并写入 <a>；空栈 = 错误
eq: 4 a b c
  set <a> to 1 if <b> is equal to <c>; set it to 0 otherwise
  若 <b> 等于 <c>，将 <a> 设为 1；否则设为 0
gt: 5 a b c
  set <a> to 1 if <b> is greater than <c>; set it to 0 otherwise
  若 <b> 大于 <c>，将 <a> 设为 1；否则设为 0
jmp: 6 a
  jump to <a>
  跳转至 <a>
jt: 7 a b
  if <a> is nonzero, jump to <b>
  若 <a> 非零，跳转至 <b>
jf: 8 a b
  if <a> is zero, jump to <b>
  若 <a> 为零，跳转至 <b>
add: 9 a b c
  assign into <a> the sum of <b> and <c> (modulo 32768)
  将 <b> 与 <c> 的和（模 32768）写入 <a>
mult: 10 a b c
  store into <a> the product of <b> and <c> (modulo 32768)
  将 <b> 与 <c> 的乘积（模 32768）写入 <a>
mod: 11 a b c
  store into <a> the remainder of <b> divided by <c>
  将 <b> 除以 <c> 的余数写入 <a>
and: 12 a b c
  stores into <a> the bitwise and of <b> and <c>
  将 <b> 与 <c> 的按位与写入 <a>
or: 13 a b c
  stores into <a> the bitwise or of <b> and <c>
  将 <b> 与 <c> 的按位或写入 <a>
not: 14 a b
  stores 15-bit bitwise inverse of <b> in <a>
  将 <b> 的 15 位按位取反结果写入 <a>
rmem: 15 a b
  read memory at address <b> and write it to <a>
  读取地址 <b> 的内存，并将其写入 <a>
wmem: 16 a b
  write the value from <b> into memory at address <a>
  将 <b> 的值写入内存地址 <a>
call: 17 a
  write the address of the next instruction to the stack and jump to <a>
  将下一条指令的地址压入栈，然后跳转至 <a>
ret: 18
  remove the top element from the stack and jump to it; empty stack = halt
  弹出栈顶元素并跳转至该地址；空栈 = 停机
out: 19 a
  write the character represented by ascii code <a> to the terminal
  向终端写入 ASCII 码 <a> 所表示的字符
in: 20 a
  read a character from the terminal and write its ascii code to <a>; it can be assumed that once input starts, it will continue until a newline is encountered; this means that you can safely read whole lines from the keyboard and trust that they will be fully read
  从终端读取一个字符，并将其 ASCII 码写入 <a>；可假定输入一旦开始，会持续到换行；
  因而可以安全地从键盘读取整行，并相信该行会完整到达
noop: 21
  no operation
  空操作
